{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39100","headline":"宫怨 · 韦庄","name":"宫怨","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一辞同辇闭昭阳，耿耿寒宵禁漏长。\n钗上翠禽应不返，镜中红艳岂重芳。\n萤低夜色栖瑶草，水咽秋声傍粉墙。\n展转令人思蜀赋，解将惆怅感君王。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦庄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39100.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39100","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}